  "translation": "Gomme Dafida a boa go bago ⟨את⟩ gae la gagwe; gomme Mikale morwadiwa Sheule a tšwa go amošela Dafida, a re: Kgoši ya Yisraele e ile ya tlotša kae gommuo, ge a itšholla gommuo mahlokong a basadi ba mehaka ya mehlanka wa gagwe, bjalo ka motho yo a fišago a se nago sepe go itšholla!",
